---
import ProjectLayout from '../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import ProjectNav from '../components/project/ProjectNav.astro';
import NextProject from '../components/project/NextProject.astro';
import '../styles/projects/abita.css';
---

<ProjectLayout title="ABiTA · Sasha">
<div class="page" style="font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #2E2326; background: #F6F1EA; min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 110px">
<div style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F2E4B8 0%, #F4ECD4 55%, #F6F1EA 100%); padding-bottom: 48px">
<ProjectNav />
<header class="wrap" style="text-align: center; padding-top: 88px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 26px; color: #6B5310">Internship project · HR system</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(64px, 12vw, 152px); letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.9">ABiTA.</h1>
<p style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6B5310; letter-spacing: 0.02em">Awal Bros Integrated Time &amp; Attendance</p>
<p style="margin: 24px auto 0; max-width: 680px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3F3436; text-wrap: balance">At the hospital, interns and outsourced staff were checking in for each other to cover secret shift swaps. ABiTA is the attendance app I designed to make that a lot harder.</p>
</header>
<div class="col" style="margin-top: 48px">
<div class="meta">
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #76632E">Year</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">2026</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #76632E">Client</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">RS Awal Bros Botania</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #76632E">Role</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">UI/UX design, from day one</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #76632E">Live demo</p><a href="https://abita.mealbar.my.id/admin/login" style="font-weight: 600">abita.mealbar.my.id ↗</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
<div class="stage" style="background: linear-gradient(140deg, #EDD892 0%, #F2E4B8 55%, #F4ECD4 100%)">
<div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">abita.mealbar.my.id/admin/login</span></div>
<img src="assets/abita-login.webp" alt="ABiTA admin sign-in screen for RS Awal Bros Botania" style="width: 100%; display: block">
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 48px">
<div class="nums">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 48px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1">35</p><p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5E5153">pages · 16 staff app, 19 dashboard</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 48px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1">129</p><p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5E5153">API endpoints</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 48px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1">23</p><p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5E5153">database tables</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 48px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1">37</p><p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5E5153">automated integration tests</p></div>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 80px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">The problem</h2>
<div class="duo">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px; position: relative">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #6B5310">PROBLEM 01</p>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #2E2326">“Titip absen, ya?”</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65">Outsourced staff and interns would quietly swap shifts, then ask a friend to check in for them. On paper everyone was there. On the floor, it was someone else.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #6B5310">PROBLEM 02</p>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #2E2326">“Who's on shift today?”</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65">HR and unit heads had a hard time keeping track of outsourced staff and their shifts. Finding out who should be where meant asking around.</p>
</div>
</div>

<h2 style="margin: 56px 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">So I designed for exactly those two</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px"><strong style="color: #2E2326">For the first one:</strong> a check-in that only works with <em>your</em> face. The camera asks you to turn your head in a random direction, so a photo or a friend holding your phone won't pass. You also have to be inside the hospital's GPS fence, during your own shift window.</p>
<p style="margin: 0"><strong style="color: #2E2326">For the second:</strong> a dashboard where HR and unit heads see every unit's schedule and today's attendance in one place. Shift swaps became an official request the unit head approves, so there's no reason to swap in secret anymore.</p>
</article>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 64px">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; max-width: 712px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Two apps, one API</h2>
<div class="apps">
<div style="background: #F2E4B8; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #6B5310">/staff</p>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 22px">Staff app</h3>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #6B5310">Interns &amp; outsourced staff</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3F3436">Face check-in and check-out, shift schedule, attendance history, leave, sick leave and shift swap requests, documents and notifications.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #6B5310">/admin</p>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 22px">Dashboard</h3>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #6B5310">HR Admin &amp; Unit Heads</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3F3436">Attendance monitoring and corrections, approvals, staff management, shift scheduling, reports, documents and system settings.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #2E2326; color: #F6F1EA; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #E8D79E">/api/v1</p>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 4px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 22px">REST API</h3>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #E8D79E">Serves both apps</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #E4DADB">Authentication, business rules, face verification, notifications, reports and database access.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 72px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Main features</h2>
<div class="feat">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px"><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326">Face check-in &amp; check-out</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55">A guided camera captures several frames, verified on the server with GPS location and the shift window.</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px"><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326">Schedule &amp; history</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55">Monthly shift calendar, attendance history and a monthly summary exportable to PDF or Excel.</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px"><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326">Requests &amp; approvals</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55">Leave, sick leave with a doctor's note and shift swaps, approved by the Unit Head or HR Admin.</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px"><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326">Staff &amp; schedule management</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55">Staff accounts, shift patterns and schedule publication for each unit.</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px"><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326">Reports &amp; documents</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55">Attendance reports in Excel or PDF, plus employee and company documents shared by unit and employment type.</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px"><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326">Notifications &amp; audit</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55">Push notifications, real-time updates and an audit log for approvals, corrections and admin changes.</p></div>
</div>

<h2 style="margin: 72px 0 12px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">How a check-in works</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 20px">ABiTA is server-authoritative: every validation decision, from face recognition and liveness to geofence and shift window, is made on the server. The phone only guides the camera.</p>
<ol class="steps" style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0">
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #6B5310">01</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5">The app opens a single-use session with a random head-turn challenge.</span></li>
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #6B5310">02</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5">Three frames are captured; the server checks quality, the head turn and matches them to the enrolled face.</span></li>
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #6B5310">03</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5">Check-in window, mock-location and geofence rules are applied.</span></li>
<li style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; color: #6B5310">04</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5">Attendance and photo are stored and the dashboard updates in real time.</span></li>
</ol>
<div style="margin-top: 28px; background: #F2E4B8; border-radius: 32px; padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 48px); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; gap: clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px)">
<figure class="phone" style="margin: 0; width: min(220px, 80vw); text-align: center"><img src="assets/abita-m-geofence.webp" alt="Location check screen: valid, 10 m from the attendance point within a 420 m radius" style="width: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 30px; border: 6px solid #2E2326; box-shadow: 0 30px 50px -30px rgba(46,35,38,0.6)"><figcaption style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4A390A"><strong>1 · Where</strong><br>GPS geofence check, re-verified by the server</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="phone" style="margin: 0; width: min(220px, 80vw); text-align: center"><img src="assets/abita-m-face.webp" alt="Face check-in camera screen with a guide frame" style="width: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 30px; border: 6px solid #2E2326; box-shadow: 0 30px 50px -30px rgba(46,35,38,0.6)"><figcaption style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4A390A"><strong>2 · Who</strong><br>Guided face capture with a liveness challenge</figcaption></figure>
</div>

<h2 style="margin: 72px 0 12px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Gathering requirements</h2>
<p style="margin: 0">Requirements came from the supervisor and from the HR team's existing Excel attendance data, which showed what information HR Admin needs to extract and file into the system's Documents section.</p>
</article>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 56px">
<div style="background: #F2E4B8; border-radius: 32px; padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 56px); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-end; gap: clamp(16px, 3vw, 40px)">
<figure class="phone" style="margin: 0; width: min(240px, 80vw); text-align: center"><img src="assets/abita-m-home.webp" alt="Staff app home with check-in button, geofence status and monthly recap" style="width: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 32px; border: 6px solid #2E2326; box-shadow: 0 30px 50px -30px rgba(46,35,38,0.6)"><figcaption style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A390A">Home &amp; check-in</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="phone" style="margin: 0; width: min(240px, 80vw); text-align: center"><img src="assets/abita-m-shift.webp" alt="Staff app monthly shift calendar with attendance legend" style="width: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 32px; border: 6px solid #2E2326; box-shadow: 0 30px 50px -30px rgba(46,35,38,0.6)"><figcaption style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A390A">Shift calendar</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="phone" style="margin: 0; width: min(240px, 80vw); text-align: center"><img src="assets/abita-m-profile.webp" alt="Staff app profile with attendance summary and settings" style="width: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 32px; border: 6px solid #2E2326; box-shadow: 0 30px 50px -30px rgba(46,35,38,0.6)"><figcaption style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A390A">Profile &amp; settings</figcaption></figure>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 72px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<figure style="margin: 0 0 32px"><div class="stage sm" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #F4ECD4 0%, #F2E4B8 100%)"><div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">abita / admin / dashboard</span></div><img src="assets/abita-dashboard.webp" alt="ABiTA admin dashboard with daily attendance summary, per-unit status, pending approvals and schedule publication" style="width: 100%; display: block"></div></div><figcaption style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">The admin dashboard: today's attendance, status per unit, items needing attention and schedule publication.</figcaption></figure>
<figure style="margin: 0 0 64px"><div class="stage sm" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #F2E4B8 0%, #F4ECD4 100%)"><div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">abita / admin / pengaturan</span></div><img src="assets/abita-settings.webp" alt="Admin settings: attendance location on a map with an adjustable geofence radius" style="width: 100%; display: block"></div></div><figcaption style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">HR Admin sets the attendance point and geofence radius from the dashboard.</figcaption></figure>
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Tech stack</h2>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden">
<div class="stack" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE6CC"><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #6B5310; background: #FBF6E8">Frontend</p><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 15px">React 19, Vite, TanStack Router &amp; Query, Tailwind CSS, installable PWA</p></div>
<div class="stack" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE6CC"><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #6B5310; background: #FBF6E8">Backend</p><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 15px">Node.js, NestJS, Drizzle ORM, Zod validation with OpenAPI docs</p></div>
<div class="stack" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE6CC"><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #6B5310; background: #FBF6E8">Database</p><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 15px">MySQL / MariaDB (23 tables)</p></div>
<div class="stack" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE6CC"><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #6B5310; background: #FBF6E8">Face recognition</p><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 15px">ONNX Runtime with YuNet (detection) and SFace (recognition), MediaPipe for camera guidance</p></div>
<div class="stack" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE6CC"><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #6B5310; background: #FBF6E8">Notifications</p><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 15px">Web Push, Server-Sent Events, SMTP email</p></div>
<div class="stack" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #EFE6CC"><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #6B5310; background: #FBF6E8">Reports &amp; files</p><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 15px">ExcelJS, PDFKit, ZIP export</p></div>
<div class="stack"><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #6B5310; background: #FBF6E8">Quality</p><p style="margin: 0; padding: 14px 20px; font-size: 15px">TypeScript, Vitest, ESLint · cPanel as the planned host</p></div>
</div>

<div style="margin-top: 64px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EFE6CC; border-radius: 28px; padding: 32px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 24px; color: #6B5310">My part</p>
<p style="margin: 0">I was on ABiTA from the blank page. I designed every screen of the staff app and the admin dashboard, worked out how the face check-in should feel on a phone, and set the look you see here. Then I stayed close to the developers while it was being built.</p>
</div>

<h2 style="margin: 64px 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Current status</h2>
<p style="margin: 0">ABiTA runs on a test deployment at <a href="https://abita.mealbar.my.id/admin/login">abita.mealbar.my.id</a>, with the staff app and the admin dashboard working end to end, covering authentication and roles, face verification, check-in windows, schedules, approvals and documents with 37 automated integration tests. It hasn't been rolled out to hospital staff yet.</p>
</article>

<div class="col" style="padding-top: 96px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6B5F60; font-weight: 600">Next project</p>
<NextProject href="ab-portal.html" name="AB-Portal" bg="#EBD9D6" />
</div>
</div>
</ProjectLayout>
